<http://data.silknow.org/object/27ecf1a7-2764-3c69-98db-8e22f61d3ae6/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Kerchief,  cotton embroidered with silk in double darning running in a single line. Satin and metal thread have been double darned, with slanted satin stitch and double stitch running in a line.\n\nThere is a border along all four sides in which a meander is formed by metal thread which gives the appearance of a twisted ribbon.  A floral sprig with a red flower and some buds grow from alternate sides of the meander.  In each corner is a diagonal arrangement of flowers and leaves: it begins with a horizontal arrangement of segments which may represent the ground; roots appear to grow down from this.  There is a small mound in the centre from which rises a vertical stem. There is a pair of slightly curving serrated leaves in two shades of green and a large central flower in shades of pink with a metal thread centre.  From this grow two pink rose buds and the vertical stem continues with a pair of leaves, a pair of delicate carnations and it ends with a bud and two leaves."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/27ecf1a7-2764-3c69-98db-8e22f61d3ae6> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/27ecf1a7-2764-3c69-98db-8e22f61d3ae6/domain/2>
