        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Cotton kerchief, Turkey, 1880s"@en , "Kerchief,  cotton embroidered with silk in double darning running in a single line. Satin and metal thread have been double darned, with slanted satin stitch and double stitch running in a line.\n\nThere is a border along all four sides in which a meander is formed by metal thread which gives the appearance of a twisted ribbon.  A floral sprig with a red flower and some buds grow from alternate sides of the meander.  In each corner is a diagonal arrangement of flowers and leaves: it begins with a horizontal arrangement of segments which may represent the ground; roots appear to grow down from this.  There is a small mound in the centre from which rises a vertical stem. There is a pair of slightly curving serrated leaves in two shades of green and a large central flower in shades of pink with a metal thread centre.  From this grow two pink rose buds and the vertical stem continues with a pair of leaves, a pair of delicate carnations and it ends with a bud and two leaves."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/51c95970-22e8-30c6-ad7c-dc702c1c685e> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/4327f852-d82d-3539-86e6-399f0d11dfea> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Cotton kerchief, Turkey, 1880s"@en , "Kerchief,  cotton embroidered with silk in double darning running in a single line. Satin and metal thread have been double darned, with slanted satin stitch and double stitch running in a line.\n\nThere is a border along all four sides in which a meander is formed by metal thread which gives the appearance of a twisted ribbon.  A floral sprig with a red flower and some buds grow from alternate sides of the meander.  In each corner is a diagonal arrangement of flowers and leaves: it begins with a horizontal arrangement of segments which may represent the ground; roots appear to grow down from this.  There is a small mound in the centre from which rises a vertical stem. There is a pair of slightly curving serrated leaves in two shades of green and a large central flower in shades of pink with a metal thread centre.  From this grow two pink rose buds and the vertical stem continues with a pair of leaves, a pair of delicate carnations and it ends with a bud and two leaves."@en ;
